{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0263_1000_p", "source_sha256": "84b792bab19f3f732bb78010dcb03ff4743f22ffa201437baec3da8a399685a0", "ja": "（グラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影が終わった。\nスムーズに進んだおかげで、時間どおりだ）", "zh": "（写真杂志《偶像写真！！》的拍摄结束了。\n多亏进展顺利，正好按时完成。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0263_1001_017kth", "source_sha256": "248514cc363d852c42259a4dcb15716cfa36fc68ac173bdf3301222f2ae020b2", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れ様でした。\nあの、どうでしたか？　私の撮影……。", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦了。\n那个，您觉得怎么样？我的拍摄……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0263_1002_017kth", "source_sha256": "6b919ca7f4dbf4e375adeea44fa94ccdb792f42664e3d859c46735a9fc57baa1", "ja": "『朝の過ごし方』といわれて、結構悩みました。\n結局、いつもの私になっちゃいましたけど。", "zh": "被问到“早晨的度过方式”，我可是烦恼了好一阵子。\n结果还是变成平时的我了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0263_1003_p", "source_sha256": "19b9eb14fecb87265357f026658244206cb806c79ad330472d1ffda21f01b321", "ja": "いい撮影だったと思うよ。\n表情も自然体だったし。", "zh": "我觉得拍得很不错哦。\n表情也很自然。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0263_1004_017kth", "source_sha256": "c57851050ba2d824481ece3d26188264e88939f08b3edc96bb6554f2bbd10d29", "ja": "よかった……。パジャマのままでも自然に見えるか\n心配だったんです。朝はすぐ着替えてしまうので。", "zh": "太好了……我之前还在担心\n穿着睡衣看起来会不会不够自然。\n因为我早上向来都是马上换衣服的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0263_1005_p", "source_sha256": "521642305f4894a7046f1c60ec1d7629854628d51ae213d9b6a51fbec286271c", "ja": "そうなのか？　気づかなかったよ……。しかし、\nすぐに着替えるって、琴葉はしっかりしてるな。", "zh": "是这样吗？我都没注意到……不过，起床后马上就换衣服，琴叶还真是自律啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0263_1006_017kth", "source_sha256": "762c2fc2484cef225a16fa696b72f1c464a3ec91c9d4475bb151d35f28ba48c0", "ja": "え、ええと……普通ですよ？\n朝は頭がスッキリしてて、すごく集中できるんです。", "zh": "诶、呃……很普通吧？\n早上的头脑很清醒，特别能集中精神。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0263_1007_017kth", "source_sha256": "72cc36db81ee693034e37d300a4381381eb800c130be1eb01fffc9a7868ea7be", "ja": "勉強したり、台本のチェックをしたり……。\n台詞を覚えるのも、朝が多いかもしれませんね。", "zh": "学习功课、检查剧本……早上可能也经常背台词吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0263_1008_p", "source_sha256": "52eae9f4c6087463d40b48111a64aff4c582cb988e842bab544617fcb90ab988", "ja": "へえ、なんていうか……\n琴葉の朝は、すごい充実してるな。", "zh": "哦，怎么说呢……琴叶的早晨，过得真充实啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0263_1009_017kth", "source_sha256": "2d6958d4c1a5a3e77853a7ee1e293b2699f043482db5677bf6c6be7511b09f26", "ja": "そ、そんなこと……。それに毎日じゃないですよ？\nたまに、寝過ぎちゃうこともありますし……。", "zh": "没、没那么夸张……而且也不是每天都这样哦？\n偶尔也会睡过头……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0263_1010_p", "source_sha256": "e9b7cfe52512de13ef74fa45b5753b72898a7f224c9a8d9c84a63bb655038320", "ja": "たまになのか……うーん。\nちょっとは琴葉を見習わないとなぁ。", "zh": "偶尔才这样吗……嗯——\n我也得稍微向琴叶学习一下才行啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0263_1011_017kth", "source_sha256": "d7dcba80105e74667ead4dfa1b004a1491845086273c1245d87e599bc827eec4", "ja": "見習うだなんて！　あの……\n{$P$}は、朝が苦手なんですか？", "zh": "哪里值得学习啊！那个……\n{$P$}，您不擅长早起吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0263_1012_p", "source_sha256": "d4c7dcda59aadc2388dc9932e675d8ccb6712ad6e0356da32e876321c64a926a", "ja": "まあ、なかなか起きられない日はあるかな……。\n仕事が遅くなると、どうしても疲れちゃって。", "zh": "嗯，确实有些日子不太容易起床……  \n工作结束得晚了，难免会觉得累。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0263_1013_017kth", "source_sha256": "aad8950b222b74e8e02fbfb53d3cae7e41d170422e711954369da03065878430", "ja": "そうなんですね……。\nあっ、そうだ。それなら、私が電話しましょうか？", "zh": "原来是这样啊……  \n啊，对了。那要不要我打电话叫你起床？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0263_1014_017kth", "source_sha256": "b4727627a75aac201199a2fa0b17f83c425ba60c7a5bfcd1aa4c290d42a0979d", "ja": "大事なお仕事の日とか、寝坊したら大変ですし。\n{$P$}がよければ、ですけど……。", "zh": "有重要工作的日子，睡过头了可就糟了。\n不过这也得看{$P$}方不方便……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0263_1015_p", "source_sha256": "5f3d0a0bd68955abbb7218e56216699c28c3d82e0e2933bb36f10cf506b3c6ec", "ja": "琴葉が？\nそれは助かるけど……面倒じゃないか？", "zh": "琴叶？那确实帮大忙了，不过……不会觉得麻烦吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0263_1016_017kth", "source_sha256": "e24fe6534457264c582373a51ffcbdaff714f8d320b81f9bb8c655e6366eea9e", "ja": "いえ、そんなことないです！　朝一番に、\n{$P$}と話せたら嬉しいですから。", "zh": "不，没那回事！因为要是能一大早和{$P$}先生聊上几句，我会很开心的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0263_1017_017kth", "source_sha256": "851b4e2a3e7346737213dbb620656bc405b7e09eef56fe40db67ca2fe4fc3278", "ja": "私に任せてください。\n責任をもって、しっかり起こしますからね♪", "zh": "交给我吧。我会负起责任，好好把您叫醒的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
